# Razi Property JB — Netlify _redirects
# Hides ".html" from every page URL.
#
# How it works (2 rules per page):
#   1) If someone visits /page.html directly, force-redirect (301) to /page
#      so the browser address bar updates and drops ".html".
#   2) When /page is requested, silently serve /page.html (200 rewrite)
#      without changing what's shown in the address bar.

# Home
/index.html                       /                                  301!
/                                  /index.html                        200

